const task = [
'Fix every SharedWorker cache review finding in /Users/user/projects/yinshi. You remain sole writer. Do not commit or touch .pi-subagents/. Strict red-green TDD.',
'1. Prevent cached-to-live bootstrap from erasing new prompts. When cached history renders, set a historyRevalidating state. Keep conversation visible but disable prompt input with a clear reason until live revalidation succeeds or fails. Then clear revalidating. Since input is blocked, live authoritative bootstrap cannot replace a newly started prompt. Preserve cancel for an already active run. Add Session tests proving cached render shows messages, input is disabled, onSend cannot start, and live completion enables input.',
'2. Bind every SharedWorker port to authenticated identity. Worker must fetch same-origin /auth/me with credentials include at connection time, validate authenticated true and canonical nonempty user_id <=256, and compare every request userId to the bound identity before cache access. A new account cannot request retained prior-user entries. Auth failure leaves port unavailable. Conversation data remains memory-only. Add tests with two ports and switched auth identities. If direct worker harness is hard, extract a port-binding helper with injected authenticate function.',
'3. Remove corrupt-delete versus live-put race. Ensure cached read, decode, and any deletion fully settle before writing live envelopes. Live request must still start immediately. Cache callback stays suppressed after live success. Add deterministic deferred test where live finishes before corrupt-cache deletion and assert final entry is fresh.',
'4. Invalidate the managed session cache immediately when prompt send starts, before backend send. Fire-and-forget deletion must not delay send. Keep terminal background refresh. Add send-then-navigation test proving stale cache is unavailable while run remains active.',
'5. Retain the SharedWorker object in SessionHistoryCacheClient. Install worker.onerror. On worker error, mark unavailable, close port, clear handle, and resolve pending requests as misses. Later requests return misses without waiting. Add tests.',
'6. Keep CSP and all bounds. Add no persistent storage. Run focused tests, full backend/frontend, static checks, typecheck, formatting, build, and diff check. Report results.'
].join('\n');
return runs.run('shared-history-cache-review-fixes', {resume:'f831bb1e', task});

