'Frontend: remove SharedWorker cache source, port, core, tests, worker CSP changes, and worker build assumptions. Keep cache client public behavior but implement encrypted sessionStorage. Fetch key from /api/runtime/history-cache-key through authenticated API. Validate exact response keys, user match, key version, canonical 32-byte key, and bounded key_id. Keep key only in module memory. Never store it.',
'Cache payload: AES-GCM with random 12-byte IV. AAD binds version, userId, sessionId, and key_id. Encrypted plaintext is strict JSON containing createdAtMs and exact raw bundle envelope array. TTL 10 minutes. Maximum plaintext 1 MiB, ciphertext record 1.5 MiB, 8 entries, 4 MiB aggregate. Outer stored record has exact keys version, key_id, iv, ciphertext, stored_at only. Canonical base64url. Cache key partitions user and 32-hex session. Corrupt, expired, wrong-key, wrong-user, malformed, oversized, decrypt-failed data is deleted and treated as miss. sessionStorage unavailable or quota failure becomes miss/ignored write.',
'Keep current cache-first loader, authoritative live revalidation, input gating, prompt-start invalidation, terminal refresh, generation guards, and active run behavior. Remove all SharedWorker and worker-src logic. Explicitly test stored sessionStorage text contains neither AES key nor known conversation markers. Test cross-user decrypt fails even if ciphertext is copied to another user key. Test refresh simulation with a new client instance decrypting prior ciphertext via fetched key. Test key fetch timeout/error fallback if existing client has such behavior.',
'Update Session cache eligibility to managed browser, authenticated user, and sessionStorage availability. No BYOC, local, hosted, desktop, or auth-disabled cache. Preserve memory-only key and tab-close cache lifetime.',
'Run red-green focused tests, full backend/frontend suites, Black, isort, flake8, mypy, typecheck, changed-file Prettier, build, verify no SharedWorker asset, and diff check. Report security properties and residual risks.'
].join('\n');
return runs.run('encrypted-tab-history-cache', {agent:'worker', task, cwd:'/Users/user/projects/yinshi', context:'fork'});

